|001|1|1|6:00 PM|
|002|2|2|7:30 PM|
|003|3|4|12:00 PM|
|004|3|5|5:00 PM|

OrderDetails

| OrderID | ItemID | Quantity | SpecialRequest |
|---------|--------|----------|----------------|
|001|101|2|No onions|
