Justification

1NF
- Atomic values only.

2NF
- Car information depends only on VIN.
- Owner information depends only on OwnerID.
- Ownership information is separated.

3NF
- Insurance information moved to its own table.
- Every non-key attribute depends only on its table's primary key.
- Eliminates redundancy and update anomalies.